  <prompt>Add a lean `Email` variant to the closed `SerializedWidgetState` union (subject, from, date, thread id, short snippet or current selection) and update the `_DiscriminatorAlignment` guard; add its derivation alongside the pillar9-visibility functions.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer. Follow ADRs strictly. React/TypeScript shared-lib expertise; comfortable extending closed discriminated unions and compile-time alignment guards without breaking structural deserialization.</role>
  <goal>The union has an Email variant that deserializes structurally (no fallback to Dashboard/Summary); the discriminator guard stays 1:1.</goal>
  <context>
